# T22a: 2P Versus with AI (GDD §3.2): the players start behind the rivals in slot order; from the
# second race (Rematch) in reverse order of the session points — the leader starts last.
wait countdown
0.8 shot vs_00_race1_countdown
wait racing
@60 shot vs_01_race1_1s
wait finished
3.5 shot vs_02_results
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Continue → scoreboard
2.0 shot vs_03_scoreboard
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Rematch
wait countdown
0.8 shot vs_04_race2_countdown
wait racing
@60 shot vs_05_race2_1s
1.0 exit
